Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:07:54 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1044/1286] Ruach Studio: the name, the dove, Writer; play
 buttons that follow the player

- The studio is Ruach Studio (Viktor): a name that outlives YuE2 -> YuE3. The mark is a
  descending dove over a wave of staff lines, drawn for it; the colours follow the theme and the
  "Studio" plate inverts by night. It is the favicon, the page title and the head of the Engine
  room's About too.
- The Write tab is Writer.
- The Collection's play buttons follow the player: the take in it shows a pause sign while it
  plays and its card is marked; a click there pauses and resumes, as the player's own button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
